    <name>Sweet Spot L09 - 2x20 @ 92%</name>
    <description>PICK THIS WHEN: Top of the sweet spot ladder: the most work that fits the format. After this, move to the 90-minute set or to threshold. Long blocks: closest to a steady climb or time-trial feel.
DAY TYPE: Medium.

Sweet Spot - level 9 of 10. 2x20 @ 92%.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 20 min @ 92%, 5 min @ 55%, 20 min @ 92%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: The classic 2x20 at upper sweet spot. Patience and pacing.

Estimated TSS: 67.</description>
